Mon Nov  9 13:30:00 UTC 2026 - Denys <288736242+StDenis1980@users.noreply.github.com>

- 0.4: gnome-branding-Vilna no longer owns /usr/etc/sudoers.d and
  /usr/share/polkit-1/rules.d. It declared them 0755, but sudo has
  sudoers.d 0750 and filesystem and polkit have rules.d 0555, so an
  installed system could not update the package (file conflicts in
  transactional-update, VM test of 0.3), and the image got sudoers.d 0755.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Mon Nov  9 11:00:00 UTC 2026 - Denys <288736242+StDenis1980@users.noreply.github.com>

- 0.3: gnome-branding-Vilna stops GNOME Initial Setup's session within
  5 s on poweroff. It locks logout down, so gnome-session-service waited
  for the 90 s default timeout and shutdown took about 90 s (Build11.3).

